---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import missionImg from '@/assets/images/about/mission/mission.png';
import mottoImg from '@/assets/images/about/mission/motto-poster.png';
import visionImg from '@/assets/images/about/mission/vision.png';

const verses = ['Matthew 4:19', 'Luke 5:4–6', 'John 21:6–8', 'Matthew 24:14'];

const rowClass = 'flex flex-col border-t border-cream xl:flex-row xl:items-stretch';
const textClass = 'flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-7.5 px-5 py-15 text-center md:px-12 xl:min-h-150 xl:justify-center xl:px-25 xl:py-0';
const imageClass = 'h-75 w-full shrink-0 object-cover md:h-100 xl:h-150 xl:w-197.5';
---

<section aria-label="Mission, vision and motto">
  <div class={rowClass}>
    <div class={textClass}>
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">Mission</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">Equipping Believers for God’s Mission</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-126.25 text-base leading-none">
        Crew419 equips and mobilizes believers for short-term mission trips to spread the Gospel, serving <span class="text-primary">“Til the Nets Are Full”.</span> Through partnerships with
        local churches and ministries, we prepare participants before they go, support them while they serve, and encourage them to continue living on mission after they return home.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={missionImg} alt="A child watching the sunrise over a village at dawn" widths={[800, 1600]} class={imageClass} />
  </div>

  <div class={rowClass}>
    <div class={textClass}>
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">Vision</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">A World Reached Through Faithful Servants</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-135.5 text-base leading-none">
        We believe every church can become a sending church and every believer can become an active participant in God’s mission. Our vision is to see lives transformed through Gospel-centered
        mission experiences that strengthen local ministries and inspire lifelong discipleship.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={visionImg} alt="Mission team members praying with a local family over an open Bible" widths={[800, 1600]} class={imageClass} />
  </div>

  <div class={rowClass}>
    <div class={textClass}>
      <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3.75">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-none font-bold uppercase">Our motto</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold md:text-5xl">Serving Until the Nets Are Full</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex max-w-152.5 flex-col gap-2.5 text-base leading-none">
        <p>
          Our motto reflects our commitment to faithfully follow where God leads and continue sharing the Gospel until His mission is complete. Inspired by Jesus’ call to His disciples to cast
          their nets in faith (Luke 5:4–6; John 21:6–8), <span class="text-primary">“Til the Nets Are Full”</span> reminds us that every person matters and every opportunity to serve has eternal
          significance.
        </p>
        <p>
          The phrase also honors the legacy of <span class="text-primary">Ron Bishop</span>, founder of SCORE International, whose words encouraged generations of believers to stay committed to
          the Great Commission. Our mission continues until the Gospel is proclaimed among all nations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.75 text-lg leading-none font-medium">
        {
          verses.map((verse, index) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3.75">
              {index > 0 && <span class="bg-foreground size-1.5 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true" />}
              {verse}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
    <Image src={mottoImg} alt="Children lining up outside a village home to meet a mission team" widths={[800, 1600]} class={imageClass} />
  </div>
</section>
